      "translations": {
        "en.basel-kadem": [
          "4.\tWith this chain of narrators, from Ibn Faddal, from Ali bin ‘Uqba, from Ayub bin Hurr, from Abdul-A’la, from Abu Abdillah, peace be upon him, that he said: Arrogance is that one disdains people and stultifies the truth."
        ]
